{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/2d101f53339040f1b807a3deaed3b05d.poster.avif?t=1773686287\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/2d101f53339040f1b807a3deaed3b05d.webm?t=1773686287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/85205d6ad7625006064ac7bdf72a5f91.poster.avif?t=1773686287\" width=800 height=535 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/85205d6ad7625006064ac7bdf72a5f91.webm?t=1773686287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Congratulations on buying your very first store! However, prepare to quickly learn that this is not your average pizza franchise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run a pizza shop by day, doing the typical job simulator activities and then as night falls you experience the tower defense aspect of Slice &amp; Dice, fighting off hordes of angry customers, bosses &amp; disgruntled members of a rival pizza shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to keep your business afloat is the least of your problems when enemies grow in numbers each night and are trying to destroy your beloved Pizzeria. <br> <br> <br><u>Key Features </u><br><br><u> </u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/560a4223a3c2a4c6d0deae39aaa600b2.poster.avif?t=1773686287\" width=800 height=535 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/560a4223a3c2a4c6d0deae39aaa600b2.webm?t=1773686287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><u> </u><br><br>  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Multi-Leveled Puzzles and Challenges</strong>: Engaging gameplay loops that include cooking simulations, tower defense strategies, competitive multiplayer modes, and team-based challenges. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/3cf567cbee3b9c9cca55d925d7da7744.poster.avif?t=1773686287\" width=800 height=535 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/3cf567cbee3b9c9cca55d925d7da7744.webm?t=1773686287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong>: Challenge your friendships by playing against them or play on the same side and upgrade your shop to the best of your crews abilities (Up to 8 players)<br> <br>  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>OST</strong>: Original Soundtrack and sound effects crafted by Brightside Movement, enhancing the culinary adventure.  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Immersive Graphics</strong>: A unique stylized environment that helps create a vibrant and delicious world where players can truly experience the art of pizza making and tomatoe sauce spilling\u00a0<br><br><u>Lore:</u><br>\u25a0 Mario Meatballs has always yearned to create the ultimate pizzeria, and now that he's found a spot within his budget, his dream has become a reality. But he will soon find out that there's a reason why the real estate was such a steal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling pizza-making simulation with a dash of tower defense, you'll step into Mario's shoes and manage every aspect of running a brick-and-mortar shop by day then at night fend off hordes of crazed lunatics and other totally normal things for a small business owner.\u00a0\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fire Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/ea038320e28b7b147179d06ab26e72459a392b14.jpg"},{"name":"Cook first Pizza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/9c1abde18fd78bfa2acb948aeea2db8cc605c785.jpg"},{"name":"Meatball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/494f7ccc85b39e6364c76ae32609798cf5c15d58.jpg"},{"name":"Kobe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/b224bfe3293277097e4b1f14eaa983109043b3c1.jpg"},{"name":"Food Fight Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/593e44ad144bcef80446c0fe3b90581f8f02b15e.jpg"},{"name":"Touchdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/e8ea43874cfd38b137d3c31585cf85300fbf2812.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/5b4ae3ae7983f30471b4e070577391e43d537464.jpg"},{"name":"A Rating","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/791b4a578d016831f5ef6e1a2816af5e7532afa7.jpg"},{"name":"S Rating","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/7e43eedbb43b9c2998a601cceb2ed0d13f821f85.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Night 10 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398560/09cd643c869a4a59ece1678e022d232ee050d313.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398560?t=1773686287","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773686287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/339